 tranquil residential experience.</li><li><strong>Convenient Retail Spaces:</strong> Enjoy unparalleled convenience with retail outlets thoughtfully located on Ground Floors 1–8, offering everything you need just steps away.</li><li><strong>Ample Parking:</strong> Enjoy the convenience of a dedicated 4-story parking facility, ensuring ample space for residents and visitors.</li><li><strong>Flexible Payment Plan:</strong> Simplify your investment with an easy 50% during construction and 50% upon completion, ensuring convenience and peace of mind.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1189,"cta":{"id":1947,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/vistara_map_aaabf969b4.jpg","hash":"vistara_map_aaabf969b4","name":"V1STARA House Location Map"},"style":null,"title":"In the Heart of Al Furjan, Close to Everything","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The V1STARA House location at Al Furjan offers unmatched convenience in Dubai. Expo 2020, Dubai Marina, and JLT, residents enjoy an ideal lifestyle. This prime location ensures easy access to all essential amenities, enhancing the comfort of V1STARA House apartments at Al Furjan. The community offers easy access to key transport hubs like Al Furjan and Discovery Gardens Metro Stations, as well as major highways including Sheikh Zayed Road (E11) and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road (E311).</p><ul><li>The Pavilion Al Furjan - 5 Minutes</li><li>Medicare Medical Center - 5 Minutes</li><li>Al Furjan Metro Station - 5 Minutes</li><li>Ibn Battuta Mall - 12 Minutes</li><li>Dubai Marina - 15 Minutes</li><li>Bluewaters Island - 15 Minutes</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3160,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/vistara